	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Commendo tibi, mi charissime <persName ref="p8418">Myconi</persName>, hunc <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>d. <persName ref="p1888">Lavateri</persName> consulis<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Der "stillstehende" Bürgermeister <persName ref="p1888">Hans Rudolf Lavater</persName>.</note> <persName ref="p1884">filium</persName><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="2"><persName ref="p1884">Ludwig Lavater</persName>; s. unten Z. <ptr target="qvzl17301-3" type="qv"/>. - Das hier nicht näher ausgeführte Anliegen, mit dem <persName ref="p1884">Ludwig</persName> sich an den <placeName ref="l28">Basler</placeName> Stadtschreiber <persName ref="p2804">Heinrich Ryhiner</persName> wenden wollte, hat mit seinem geplanten Studienaufenthalt in <placeName ref="l378">Paris</placeName> zu tun; s. <ref target="file13084">Nr. 3035</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17304-6" type="qv"/>. Dort studierte nämlich schon <persName ref="p2804">Ryhiners</persName> Sohn <persName ref="p6310">Johann Heinrich</persName>; s. <bibl>AK</bibl> VI 20f. Wir danken Rainer Henrich für letzteren Hinweis.<ptr target="zfnfn17301-2" type="zfn"/></note>, hominem doctum et pium, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>valde diligenter.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Iuva illum!</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Ipse tibi, cur <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>adsit, exponet.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Spero te meas<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Brief <ref target="file13069">Nr. 3020</ref> vom 23. September, dem <persName ref="p8018">Johannes Hallers</persName> Brief an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> <ref target="file13054">Nr. 3005</ref> vom 9. September beigelegt war; s. <ref target="file13069">Nr. 3020</ref>, <ptr target="qvfn17288-1" type="qv"/>.</note> accepisse a <lb xml:id="p1z5"/><persName ref="p3559">Hartmanno a Hallwyl</persName>.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Eas,<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Hier ist allein <persName ref="p8018">Hallers</persName> Brief gemeint.</note> uti in literis monui <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>scriptis,<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Siehe <ref target="file13069">Nr. 3020</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17288-2" type="qv"/>.</note> repeto.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Mitto his inclusas <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>binas<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Einer dieser beiden Briefe war <persName ref="p8018">Hallers</persName> Brief <ref target="file13066">Nr. 3017</ref> vom 20. September, wie aus <ref target="file13084">Nr. 3035</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17304-3" type="qv"/>, hervorgeht; der andere <persName ref="p8055">Ambrosius Blarers</persName> Brief <ref target="file13072">Nr. 3023</ref> vom 29. September, wie aus <ref target="file13084">Nr. 3035</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17304-4" type="qv"/>, deutlich wird.<ptr target="zfnfn17301-1" type="zfn"/></note>, sed ea lege, ut per hunc<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><persName ref="p1884">Ludwig Lavater</persName>.</note> remittas.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Propter <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>negotia non potui plura.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Scripsit ad me <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>d. <persName ref="p8032">Dryander</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p8032">Francisco de Enzinas</persName>. - Dessen hier angesprochener Brief ist nicht erhalten.</note> per <persName ref="p4851">Froschoverum</persName> redeuntem <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>a <placeName ref="l157">Franckfordia</placeName>.<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Von der Herbstbuchmesse.</note></s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Illum amicissime salutabis.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Scribam illi,<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Nur ein Brief <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> an <persName ref="p8032">Enzinas</persName> (vom 31. August 1549 - Cambridge, Corpus Christi College, Ms. 119, Nr. 68, 183f) ist erhalten geblieben.</note> quamprimum licuerit <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>per occu-<pb type="edition" next="527"/>pationes.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Valeat et <persName ref="p1278">Gastius</persName>, a quo nond<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>um accepi <persName ref="p18967">Persium</persName>.<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Siehe dazu <ref target="file13033">Nr. 2984</ref>, <ptr target="qvfn17249-6" type="qv"/>, und zuletzt <ref target="file13069">Nr. 3020</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17288-1" type="qv"/>.</note></s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Vale.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>, 5. <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>octobris circa 9. noctis 1547.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Salutem dicito archigrammateo vestro<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><placeName ref="l28">Basels</placeName> Stadtschreiber <persName ref="p2804">Heinrich Ryhiner</persName>. - Siehe dazu oben <ptr target="qvfn17301-2" type="qv"/>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>et ora m<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>eo nomine, ut <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>causam huius <persName ref="p1884">Ludo<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>vici</persName> habeat commendatam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">D. <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><persName ref="p8418">Myconio</persName> suo.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z2"/><placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
